278r2mg6ixd 3. https://sta.sh/0k1ja8v3adq\n\nreferences for pose 1. https://sta.sh/0ufsyy8di0d 2. https://sta.sh/0sozjsty4p7 3. https://sta.sh/01hzsy3ciyyy\n\nplease make drawing sexy. thank you.", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Shibazakie_/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 276572, "client_id": 2504001, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b057f735/uploads/origins/58d159d8-ae3f-490e-872a-f4b2e5026b90?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a26bf57030121a8e02e13542691f43c7", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b057f735/uploads/origins/58d159d8-ae3f-490e-872a-f4b2e5026b90?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=56b81a27830205f15612b55fa3b33ab7", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello, it’s nice to meet you! I hope you’re well. I found your artwork and love your style! Will you please draw my rabbit girl OC? I would like her draw similar to your previous work: \n\nhttps://skeb.jp/@Shibazakie_/works/1.\n\nI would like her in a bunny suit, you can draw it however you like. Please don’t draw any bunny ears headband and just use her real rabbit ears. She is a flirty and outgoing woman. Please note the two stars and beauty mark below her left eye. \n\nThank you for your consideration!\nPlease appeal the amount if it is not correct for this request. \n\nCharacter commissions: \nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-V0ONPMOvZH0fU4WRNXctadRvTQ5ox90\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-_aJPqh-3YNa-NIYMB1XYnHJghpYV87K", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Shibazakie_/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 276572, "client_id": 80170, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e4062385/uploads/origins/a23e7ca3-642e-40b0-a2ec-b330f0022d72?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7f7d02ad778b6eacc30264dbaa2f4ad8", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e4062385/uploads/origins/a23e7ca3-642e-40b0-a2ec-b330f0022d72?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=bf712d7e39881c8b5de7120972805cc2", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Could you please draw the OC in the document URL?\nShe is a tall, nice-bodied, and receptive older woman.\nI will leave the costume, composition, etc. to you.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/10RPQdqpj14tJTM1Z5Id2FIgeWXq1NiNN?usp=sharing", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Shibazakie_/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 276572, "client_id": 3038910, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/604930d1/uploads/origins/78ddf244-8033-42f3-bdad-629ae93d5345?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f672b3317c22883624906471852f4192", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/604930d1/uploads/origins/78ddf244-8033-42f3-bdad-629ae93d5345?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=efceb12261fd6c655d059518adedcecc", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello(⁎⁍̴̛ᴗ⁍̴̛⁎)\nIf it’s okay, I would like to request a header image for X (Twitter) and also a profile picture!\n\nMy character is a maid at a virtual café. While working, she appears expressionless and highly competent, but in private, she’s actually a clumsy otaku. After work, she enjoys curling up in bed to play games. Occasionally, she makes “dark cuisine” cakes and cookies and forces them on everyone. ( ̀⌄ ́)\n\nPlease feel free to use your creativity for the design! You can change her outfit, but if possible, keep some key features.\n\nThe intended uses are for Vtuber streaming events and display on social media.\n\nIf it’s possible to provide PSD data with separate layers for the character and background, that would be greatly appreciated!\n\nSorry for the long message orz\nThank you for considering my request!!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1KBLvBo_Cu87yEHwXxW-F34mZbhbwwyQ9", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Shibazakie_/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 276572, "client_id": 3173637, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b2d58b3e/uploads/origins/a413d6e8-35d8-4bbc-8c2f-ff4975b7c0f3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3f930e61da2a4301ca9408eecbfe09d5", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b2d58b3e/uploads/origins/a413d6e8-35d8-4bbc-8c2f-ff4975b7c0f3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=24d0aa655533ad37bf52d47d2e7fad9c", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello, my name is Aki. It's nice to meet you! I really like seeing your art, and I was hoping I could make a request please. Could you draw this dullahan girl for me please?\n\nhttps://x.com/HINJAKUGORIRA/status/1857555167576732033\n\nI would like to see her with the head that has black hair and red eyes. The head should be detached from her body, so you can tell she's a dullahan, and I would like to be able to see her neck stump attached to her body. Also, I would like her to be wearing a sun hairpin, like the one the head with brown hair is wearing. 